# Repository root — health-policy-simulator

Monorepo root. The agent workspace and the backend application live in `backend/`; its own
`.gitignore` covers Python artefacts.

# ── OS / editors ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── Node / frontend (frontend/ intentionally absent; scaffold later if needed) ──
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Agent runtime state (regenerated, never merged) ───────────────────────────
backend/guardian-sessions.json
backend/.pi/.guardian-epic-state.json
backend/.pi/.guardian-pipeline-state.json
backend/.pi/preflight_report.json
backend/.pi/workspaces/
